{
  "name": "personal-cloud-drive",
  "version": "1.3.4",
  "changelog": [
    "彻底消除 AI 抽屉开合结束时的末尾微抖动：改用真实目标容器宽度同步预采样（0.00px 误差）与相对面板坐标 FLIP，动画结束解锁宽度与清除变换时网格宽度与每张卡片位置零偏移、零回弹",
    "AI 抽屉拖拽调宽丝滑度全面升级：拖拽按下时一次性缓存侧栏与边界几何尺寸，消除每帧 3 次同步强制回流造成的卡顿；移除 620px 处 3 列反跳 4 小列的生硬突变；跨列断点时自动触发 220ms GPU FLIP 卡片平滑过渡，松手即净零残留"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "description": "DPSir 个人私有智云盘 (Personal Cloud Drive) - 核心服务与依赖配置",
  "main": "server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node server.js",
    "start:watchdog": "node scripts/server-watchdog.js",
    "test:smoke": "node tests/smoke.js",
    "test:isolation": "node tests/test_avatar_isolation.js",
    "test:security": "node tests/test_password_and_recovery.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "archiver": "^7.0.1",
    "compression": "^1.8.1",
    "dompurify": "^3.1.6",
    "express": "^4.19.2",
    "fast-xml-parser": "^5.9.3",
    "jszip": "^3.10.1",
    "katex": "^0.16.11",
    "mammoth": "^1.12.0",
    "marked": "^12.0.2",
    "multer": "^2.2.0",
    "pdf-parse": "^1.1.1",
    "tesseract.js": "^5.1.1",
    "xlsx": "^0.18.5"
  }
}